be u32/noRegionId u32:4294967295.
: @dc l8589993546
be dc/dcZero dc:0.
: @dc l8589993547
be u128/u128Zero u128:0.
: @dc l8589993548
be u128/u128SysStart u128:8589934592.
: @dc l8589993549
be u128/u128SysEnd u128:12884901887.
: @dc l8589993550
be u128/u128U64Max u128:18446744073709551615.
