        nop.
    structNew scanModRes: ok true mods /frozen ::.

: Extracts `uses` (`Dc 2195..Dc 2196`) + body declaration slice from a StageL/StageR `Module`
: or standalone `TopDecl` (`2199`, `2200`, `2203`, `2217`, `2223`, `2224`, `2230`), stripping
: test blocks from dependency routines and matching `wantStager`.
: @dc l8589992867
v/tup: b l/graphDeclItem ::/unpackGraphEntryTokens dc/subj u128/sid l/dc/rawTokens b/wantStager b/needDialectFilter
    be l/dc/tokens stripLeadingComments /rawTokens.
    be u64/n len /tokens.
    if eq /n u64:0
        return tupNew: false l/graphDeclItem: :: ::
        nop.
    be dc/first dcAtOr /tokens u64:0 dc:0.
    if or eq /first dc:2192 eq /first dc:2221
        do
            be tup: b bundledMod u64 ::/mr parseModuleAt /tokens u64:0 false false.
            if not field /mr u32:0
                return tupNew: false l/graphDeclItem: :: ::
                nop.
            be bundledMod/bm field /mr u32:1.
            if and /needDialectFilter ne field /bm isStager /wantStager
                return tupNew: true l/graphDeclItem: :: ::
                nop.
            : Extract raw body slice inside `open..uses..close` (preserving multiple decls as one bundled module entry).
            hold u64/bp skipAllComments /tokens u64:1.
            if lt /bp /n
