: Wraps an anonymous `Dc 2240..Dc 2241` graph routine value node into a `Dc 2203..Dc 2204`
: top-level routine declaration carrying `(isPub, subj, identBytes)`. Non-`2240` inputs pass through.
: @dc l8589998206
v/l/dc/wrapRoutineValueNodeIf2240 dc/subj b/isPub l/u8/identBytes l/dc/rawTokens
    be l/dc/tokens stripLeadingComments /rawTokens.
    be u64/n len /tokens.
    if or lt /n u64:3 ne dcShortId dcAtOr /tokens u64:0 /dcZero u32:2240
        return /rawTokens
        nop.
    if ne dcShortId dcAtOr /tokens wrapDiff /n u64:1 /dcZero u32:2241
        return /rawTokens
        nop.
    be u64/retStart skipAllComments /tokens u64:1.
    be u64/retEnd skipTokenDcType /tokens /retStart.
    be u64/bodyEnd wrapDiff /n u64:1.
